close_reason: Accepted explicit duration units with package-owned help and SDK compatibility
body: "Context: pm-zoe4 added minute units while retaining m=months; GH-450 demonstrated silent wrong scheduling data. Decision: reject bare m in event durations and suggest min/mo. Keep h/d/w and ISO PT time forms; preserve m in other relative date fields. Consequences: callers using duration=5m must choose 5min or 5mo. Public scheduling SDK operations remain callable; calendar owns CLI shortcut declarations and aliases. Evidence: shared parser tests and real installed-package acceptance verify explicit units and refusal before mutation."
